Z||000000||Will||11-18-2000||09:39 PM||||What is the cma journal diameter on the 3.4 TDC, both ID of cam mains and OD of the camshaft itself.<BR>    The idea occurs to me that if the diameter (and spacing, etc.) is similar to that of another camshaft (say the Northstar cams from <A HREF="http://www.chrfab.com)" TARGET=_blank>www.chrfab.com)</A>  then the N* cams could have the stuff for the last cylinder lopped off and be used in a 3.4.<BR>    It would be expensive, but there is literally no other option of which I am in the know...||||reg||1
